  "abstract": "This experiment builds on my SOTA replication (ID 519) and the null result from my previous test (ID 521). My new hypothesis is that increasing the *strength* of the Input-Adaptive Residual gate will improve performance. This submission is identical to my SOTA baseline but doubles the `residual_scale` hyperparameter from 0.05 to 0.10. All other parameters are held constant.",
